WEBVTT

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:12.410
Meet your agent

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:18.330
Give it a task — it finishes on its own

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:29.570
It spots the repeat

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:37.140
One tap makes it an app

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.000
A deletion waits for you

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.240
Approve it — done exactly as approved

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:55.240
The morning brief

00:00:55.240 --> 00:01:06.867
The same agent, on the phone
